sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin
  participant Web as Trusted Talence Server
  participant DB as Supabase Postgres
  participant Auth as Supabase Auth
  actor Invitee

  Admin->>Web: Issue invitation(email, expiry)
  Web->>DB: Upsert app_private.invited_users
  Web->>Auth: inviteUserByEmail(email, metadata)
  Auth->>DB: Before User Created hook
  DB-->>Auth: Allow only valid invited email
  Auth-->>Invitee: Managed invitation email
  Invitee->>Auth: Accept invite / establish session
  Auth-->>Web: Auth callback with verified session
  Web->>DB: finalize_admitted_user(auth.uid())
  DB->>DB: Lock invitation and validate link
  DB->>DB: Create profile + personal workspace
  DB->>DB: Create owner membership + default collection
  DB-->>Web: Canonical resource IDs
  Web-->>Invitee: Enter private application
